406
00:38:59.530 --> 00:39:13.589
Carly Huitema (University of Guelph): Cryptographic binding does not freeze data in place. Instead, it creates integrity guarantees. It allows identities to evolve, rotating keys, updating endpoints, adding services, while preserving a trustworthy, verifiable history.

